e for our team. If I take control with BlackJoker or ♦K, I\'ll be stuck leading with 9 cards, which is far worse than letting my teammate (with 2 cards) attempt to finish. The peasant strategy is cooperative - help the teammate in the better position to win.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": []}'}
